# Arc's "Recent pages on Linear, Notion, and Figma" preview on pinned tabs and favorites (#376): resting on a pinned
# Linear tab that isn't open shows the card right of the sidebar with the pages from the history,
# newest first, without the tab's own page; a pinned Figma tab with no Figma history shows Arc's
# "Recent Figma files appear here." line. Nothing is fetched: the run is offline.
budget rss=700 stalls50=10
seed settings.json {"hasSeenImportPrompt": true, "toolbarDefaultMigrated": true}
