# A page of our own is the open tab, so neither pinned tab is.
cra://open?url=${PAGE}
# Its load settles first: a sidebar update puts the hover back where the pointer is.
wait 3

# Linear: Previews, CRA-12 and CRA-7 (not Inbox, the tab's own page): three 36 pt rows and room for the ＋.
cra://debug?hover=TabRowView,0
wait 1
expect-log preview card shown: 238x152 pinned$
cra://debug?previewDismiss=1

# Figma with no Figma history: Arc's empty line.
cra://debug?hover=TabRowView,1
wait 1
expect-log preview card shown: 240x[0-9]+ pinned$
cra://debug?previewDismiss=1

# A Notion favorite: Roadmap only (Notion's sign-in callback never shows), under the tile.
cra://debug?hover=FavoriteTileView,0
wait 1
expect-log preview card shown: 238x78$
cra://debug?previewDismiss=1
